The [[Netherlands national football team|Netherlands]] and [[Argentina national football team|Argentina]] had previously met nine times, [[Argentina–Netherlands football rivalry|developing a rivalry]] with one another; the Dutch won four of the nine matches, while the Argentines won one match, with the other four matches ending in a draw, two of which saw Argentina winning on penalties. Five of the prior matches occurred in the World Cup: a 4–0 win for the Dutch at the [[1974 FIFA World Cup Group A#Netherlands vs Argentina|second group stage]] in 1974 was answered by a 3–1 win for the Argentines in the [[1978 FIFA World Cup final|1978 final]]. The Dutch won 2–1 in the [[1998 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Netherlands vs Argentina|1998 quarter-finals]] prior to two goalless draws in the [[2006 FIFA World Cup Group C#Netherlands v Argentina|2006 group stage]] and at the semi-final stage of the previous major tournament where they both had made an appearance, the [[2014 FIFA World Cup]] held in Brazil, finished in a 0–0 draw after extra-time, with Argentina going through after winning the penalties 4–2.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2014brazil/match-center/300186490 |title=Match Report |date=9 July 2014 |access-date=11 December 2022 |work=FIFA |archive-date=10 October 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221010071912/https://www.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2014brazil/match-center/300186490 |url-status=live}}</ref> The previous game had been similarly intense and close but had not featured the same level of animosity between the players. [[Lionel Messi]] for Argentina and [[Daley Blind]] for the Netherlands were the only players who took part in [[2014 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Netherlands vs Argentina|that fixture]] who were also on the pitch in Lusail, in addition to Netherlands manager [[Louis van Gaal]].<ref>{{cite web |last=Ramsay |first=George |url=https://www.cnn.com/2022/12/08/football/argentina-netherlands-preview-lionel-messi-world-cup-spt-intl/index.html |title='Aging Genius' Lionel Messi looking to inspire Argentina against Netherlands |publisher=[[CNN]] |date=8 December 2022 |accessdate=11 July 2023|archive-date=26 January 2023|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230126145347/https://www.cnn.com/2022/12/08/football/argentina-netherlands-preview-lionel-messi-world-cup-spt-intl/index.html|url-status=live}}</ref>

The Netherlands entered the game having been undefeated in their 19 previous international matches.<ref>{{cite web |last=Lewis |first=Russell |url=https://www.npr.org/2022/12/09/1141924263/argentina-netherlands-fifa-world-cup-quarterfinal |title=Argentina beats the Netherlands in penalty kicks at the World Cup quarterfinals |publisher=[[NPR]] |date=9 December 2022 |accessdate=27 December 2022|archive-date=27 December 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221227002345/https://www.npr.org/2022/12/09/1141924263/argentina-netherlands-fifa-world-cup-quarterfinal|url-status=live}}</ref> During pre-match interviews with the media, the Dutch side offered comments that were later revealed to have upset the Argentine side.<ref name="ESPN2022">{{cite web |last= |first= |url=https://www.espn.com/soccer/argentina-arg/story/4829757/lionel-messi-says-netherlands-coach-van-gaal-disrespected-him-before-argentina-world-cup-win |title=Lionel Messi says Netherlands coach Van Gaal 'disrespected' him before Argentina World Cup win |publisher=[[ESPN]] |date=9 December 2022 |accessdate=20 December 2022|archive-date=20 December 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221220093145/https://www.espn.com/soccer/argentina-arg/story/4829757/lionel-messi-says-netherlands-coach-van-gaal-disrespected-him-before-argentina-world-cup-win/|url-status=live}}</ref> Van Gaal stated to Dutch publication [[Nederlandse Omroep Stichting]]: "Messi is indeed the most dangerous player who creates the most chances and also makes them himself. But on the other hand he does not play much with the opponent when he has possession of the ball. That is also where our chances lie."<ref name="Grounds2022">{{Cite web |last=Grounds |first=Ben |url=https://www.skysports.com/football/news/12098/12765182/lionel-messi-slams-louis-van-gaal-for-long-balls-as-argentina-beat-netherlands-emi-martinez-referee-was-useless |title=Lionel Messi slams Louis van Gaal for 'long balls' as Argentina beat Netherlands – Emi Martinez: Referee was useless |publisher=[[Sky Sports]] |date=10 December 2022 |accessdate=10 July 2023 |archive-date=17 December 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221217152031/https://www.skysports.com/football/news/12098/12765182/lionel-messi-slams-louis-van-gaal-for-long-balls-as-argentina-beat-netherlands-emi-martinez-referee-was-useless |url-status=live}}</ref> After the two countries' previous World Cup matchup ended in a penalty shootout, the Dutch manager insisted that the team were practicing for such an outcome, stating "we hope we will have a minor advantage if we have to take penalties."<ref>{{cite web |last=Sengupta |first=Ayon |url=https://sportstar.thehindu.com/football/fifa-world-cup/news/argentina-vs-netherlands-quarterfinal-messi-fifa-world-cup-qatar-2022-preview-arg-v-ned-team-news/article66240375.ece |title=FIFA World Cup Qatar 2022: Messi and Argentina take on Netherlands in battle of heavyweights |work=[[Sportstar]] |date=8 December 2022 |accessdate=13 February 2024|archive-date=4 June 2023|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230604202405/https://sportstar.thehindu.com/football/fifa-world-cup/news/argentina-vs-netherlands-quarterfinal-messi-fifa-world-cup-qatar-2022-preview-arg-v-ned-team-news/article66240375.ece |url-status=live}}</ref> Argentine goalkeeper [[Emiliano Martínez]] later stated that he screenshotted Van Gaal's comments on his phone and referred to them frequently as motivation.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Armesto |first=Juan Manuel |title=Dibu Martínez tras el pase a semis: "Le saqué captura a lo que dijo Van Gaal" |url=https://www.datadiario.com/no-hay-dt/dibu-martinez-tras-el-pase-a-semis-le-saque-captura-a-lo-que-dijo-van-gaal--20221292130 |access-date=2024-04-05 |website=Data Diario |language=es}}</ref> Dutch goalkeeper [[Andries Noppert]] told reporters days before the match that he felt confident in beating Messi from the penalty spot.<ref>{{cite web |last=Mayo |first=Marc |date=8 December 2022 |title=I can beat Lionel Messi from the penalty spot, says Dutch keeper amid Argentina star's subpar spot-kick stats |url=https://www.standard.co.uk/sport/football/messi-argentina-netherlands-penalty-world-cup-2022-noppert-b1045715.html |website=[[Evening Standard|The Standard]] |archive-date=14 December 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221214125603/https://www.standard.co.uk/sport/football/messi-argentina-netherlands-penalty-world-cup-2022-noppert-b1045715.html |access-date=13 February 2024 |url-status=live}}</ref> Van Gaal also said that "we've got a score to settle with Argentina for what happened two World Cups ago."<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.fifa.com/fifaplus/en/articles/netherlands-argentina-messi-memphis-blind-di-maria-quarter-finals-fifa-world-cup-preview |title=Netherlands v Argentina: Team news, preview and how to watch |publisher=[[FIFA]] |accessdate=20 December 2022|archive-date=21 December 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221221031030/https://www.fifa.com/fifaplus/en/articles/netherlands-argentina-messi-memphis-blind-di-maria-quarter-finals-fifa-world-cup-preview|url-status=live}}</ref>

